Package: grdwtrsmpkwale
Title: Groundwater analysis from 2016 in Kwale, Kenya
Version: 0.0.1
Description: The goal of grdwtrsmpkwale is to provide datasets for research and planning of water and solid waste management in Kwale, Kenya. This package includes water analysis data collected in 2016 combined with the geospatial data from the collection points.
License: CC BY 4.0
